Title:  Intelligence plus Character

Seq:    12.6.89.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[King, Martin Luther Jr.|Martin Luther King Jr.]], 1947, from the article "[[The Maroon Tiger]]"

Timestamp: 20251218192019

